---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import matrix from '../assets/matrix.svg'
import rollMoverIllustration from '../assets/rollMoverIllustration.png';
---

<div
    id="challenge"
    class=" flex flex-col md:flex-row relative"
>
  <div class="px-12 md:w-1/2 flex flex-col items-center justify-center">
    <Image
        src={matrix}
        alt="Decorative image"
        class="matrix"
    />
    <Image
        src={rollMoverIllustration}
        alt="Illustration of a roll mover"
        style="max-width: 300px; width: 100%;"
        class="mx-auto z-10 relative"
    />
  </div>
  <div class="mt-12 md:mt-0 md:w-1/2 flex flex-col justify-center">
    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-foreground mb-6">Is Your Mover Running Out of Power Mid-Shift?</h2>
    <p class="text-lg text-muted-foreground mb-6">
      A worn-out battery is the most common reason a roll mover or cart mover slows down, stalls under a full load
      or dies before the shift ends.
    </p>
    <p class="text-lg text-muted-foreground">
      Replacing the original pack can be expensive and slow. A compatible pack matched to your Appleton part number
      gets the unit back to full runtime without the wait.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .matrix {
      position: absolute;
      z-index: 0;
      max-width: 350px;
      opacity: .5;
      filter: invert(1);
  }
</style>
